     <p>Suppose you are an individual tax resident outside Spain with no permanent establishment in Spain. You bought a holiday flat in Valencia for €180,000 in 2018 as its sole owner and sell it at its market value of €200,000 in 2026. You have never let it. For this example, leave out all buying and selling costs, including transaction taxes, and assume there were no improvements and no other adjustments or reliefs apply.</p>
